// SFX — All-ready chime (everyone ready -> early advance)
// Status: DONE (owner-approved 2026-07-19)
// The completion of sfx-ready-click: three rising triangle notes instead of two, slightly
// louder — it has to announce the early advance over the drawing music.
// Render: one hit, WAV. Audition chimes once per second.
// Paste into https://strudel.cc — spec: TDD/sound/stinger-sfx-spec.md

setcpm(60)

note("[f4 a4 c5@2] ~ ~ ~")
  .sound("triangle")
  .attack(.001).decay(.14).sustain(0).release(.08)
  .lpf(2600)
  .gain(.5)
